  "citation": "Schwenk J; Piliouras A; Rowland J (2023): Observations and Machine-Learned Models of Near-Surface Permafrost along the Koyukuk River, Alaska, USA. Incorporating the Hydrological Controls on Carbon Cycling in Floodplain Ecosystems into Earth System Models (ESMs). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1922517",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
